    %% Mobile to Cloud Run
    Cam -->|"Base64 JPEG\n(2 fps)"| WS_Client
    Mic -->|"PCM Audio\n(16kHz)"| WS_Client
    WS_Client <-->|"Bidirectional\nWebSocket (wss://)"| FastAPI
