    FastAPI -->|"Audio PCM"| WS_Client
    WS_Client --> Spk
    FastAPI -->|"UI Actions\n+ Mode Data"| WS_Client
    WS_Client --> UI
    UI --> Export

    %% Firestore connections
    ToolReg -->|"upsert_memory\nlog_resolution"| Firestore
    FastAPI -->|"Save Session"| Firestore
    RivState -->|"Fetch Archive"| Firestore
